# Placeholder file to satisfy Go's //go:embed all:dist directive.
#
# The web/dist/ folder MUST contain at least one file for `go build` to work
# (Go's embed package refuses to embed empty directories).
#
# The real contents of this folder (Vite/React dashboard build output) are
# generated during CI / production build by running:
#   $ cd web && npm install && npm run build
#
# That command will populate this folder with: index.html, assets/*.js,
# assets/*.css, etc. Those are the files that get embedded into the
# final aetrna-bot Go binary for the web dashboard UI.
#
# This placeholder MUST remain in version control. DO NOT DELETE.
